    feat(designer): add right tool dock with workflow configuration panel
    
    Replace the standalone PropertyPanel with a right tool dock (ADR 0008) that switches between workflow configuration and node properties.
    
    - Add WorkflowConfigPanel: read-only basic info plus CRUD for variables, inputs, outputs and outcomes, all through the command stack (undo/redo)
    
    - Add cascadeRename in core/designer to rewrite structured Variable/Input references on rename (JS/Liquid text untouched)
    
    - Extend useWorkflowDesigner with outputs/outcomes/variableTypes state and setInputs/setOutputs/setOutcomes/renameReference
    
    - Add ExpressionEditor allowedTypes prop; input defaults limited to Literal/Liquid/JavaScript, outputs allow all types (ADR 0009)
    
    - Extract NodePropertyPanel from PropertyPanel; remove dead PropertyPanel and VariablesDialog
    
    Closes #18

